,"textMapHash":318134618,"text":"非常に高き場所だ…","nextNodeIds":[722480317]},{"nodeId":722480317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":1025161354,"text":"高いが、日の光はなく、氷のように冷たかった。","nextNodeIds":[722480318]},{"nodeId":722480318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3981686698,"text":"…おかしい、なぜだ。","nextNodeIds":[722480319]},{"nodeId":722480319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":618795410,"text":"なぜ吾は、高い場所が暖かくあるべきだと思っていた…？","nextNodeIds":[722480320]},{"nodeId":722480320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3280852010,"text":"なぜ…なぜ吾は何も思い出せない…？","nextNodeIds":[722480321]},{"nodeId":722480321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":687974858,"text":"うーん、おなかが空いてるとかじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[722480322]},{"nodeId":722480322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3699206170,"text":"オイラもおなかが空いてると、頭を働かせるどころか、会話すらまともにできなくなるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[722480323,722480325]},{"nodeId":722480323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4221992882,"text":"たぶん、それじゃないと思う…","nextNodeIds":[722480324]},{"nodeId":722480324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":763160130,"text":"いや、ぜったいそうだって！ほら、この残魂さん、もう話もまともにできないみたいだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[722480327]},{"nodeId":722480327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2658208954,"text":"そうだ、辺りに供え物がないか探してみようぜ。それなら、きっと食べ物があるはずだよな？","nextNodeIds":[722480328]},{"nodeId":722480328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":4244401682,"text":"そうだ！供え物！","nextNodeIds":[722480329]},{"nodeId":722480329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":971919482,"text":"ん？供え物が食べたくなったのか？","nextNodeIds":[722480330]},{"nodeId":722480330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":1046330778,"text":"いや、吾は思い出したのだ…","nextNodeIds":[722480331]},{"nodeId":722480331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":2941189770,"text":"吾が監禁されて死した後、ヘリオスを建造した功績により、遺体と衣服は各地に奉納された。","nextNodeIds":[722480332]},{"nodeId":722480332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3344069714,"text":"だがそれが原因で、魂は散り散りになり、安らぎを得られないのだ。","nextNodeIds":[722480333]},{"nodeId":722480333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":561224626,"text":"ここには吾の聖冠が納めてあるが、すでに朽ち果てている…吾の頭が働かないのも、そのせいだろう。","nextNodeIds":[722480334]},{"nodeId":722480334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3751927082,"text":"長き時が経ったゆえ、今の状態を維持するだけでも困難なことなのだ…","nextNodeIds":[722480335]},{"nodeId":722480335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":15032834,"text":"だが幸い、これらの供え物は遺体や衣服の代わりに、吾の想いを込めることができる。","nextNodeIds":[722480336]},{"nodeId":722480336,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":622683026,"text":"頼む、吾の代わりにこれを持っていってほしい。","nextNodeIds":[722480337]},{"nodeId":722480337,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3576101066,"text":"だが道中、多くの危険に見舞われるだろう。嫌気が差すこともあるかもしれぬが、それでもこの試練を受けてはくれないか…","nextNodeIds":[722480338]},{"nodeId":722480338,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2289427690,"text":"試練？なんだよ試練って？","nextNodeIds":[722480339]},{"nodeId":722480339,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":3717261306,"text":"吾の残魂を見張っている怪物を倒してくれ…","nextNodeIds":[722480340]},{"nodeId":722480340,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20356,"speakerName":"阿倍良久","textMapHash":2378469898,"text":"これは極めて危険なことだ。旅人よ、準備ができたら、吾に言ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722480325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅